  "Title": "\u200b\u200bUbuntu! Imagining a Humanist Education Globally\u200b",
  "NewsSubTitle": null,
  "NewsSummary": "\u200bIED faculty at the 59th Annual Conference of the Comparative and International Education Society\u200b",
  "GlobalNews": false,
  "AlternateNewsTitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSubtitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSummary": null,
  "NewsContent": "<div class=\"ExternalClassC8BFA03B17404F9B991F5F29AC299C2F\"><div>Three of our faculty members presented research papers at the <a href=\"http&#58;//convention2.allacademic.com/one/cies/cies15/index.php?cmd=Prepare+Online+Program&amp;program_focus=main&amp;PHPSESSID=bjmehn08rqo2ljvv6k7vd0inu3\" target=\"_blank\">59th Annual Conference of the Comparative and International Education Society\u200b</a>, held between March 8 to13, 2015 in Washington, D.C. The theme of the conference was \u201cUbuntu! Imagining a Humanist Education Globally\u201d\u200b.</div><div>Click on the titles to read the abstracts of the papers.</div><div><br></div><div><strong>&#160;Dr Dilshad Ashraf&#58;</strong></div><div><ul><li><a href=\"http&#58;//tinyurl.com/kgounun\" target=\"_blank\">Reconstructing life&#58; Women teachers and gender equality discourse in Pakistan&#160;</a><br></li><li><a href=\"http&#58;//tinyurl.com/oftr6xy\" target=\"_blank\">Rethinking Masculinity and Femininity&#58; Mentors\u2019 and Lead Teachers\u2019 Experiences of Shifting Positions in Pakistan&#160;</a><br></li></ul></div><div><strong>Dr Nusrat Fatima Rizvi&#58;</strong></div><div><ul><li><a href=\"http&#58;//tinyurl.com/ml8x6nm\" target=\"_blank\">Exploring efficacy of Geogebra in development of geometrical reasoning skills of students of grade 7&#160;\u200b</a><br></li><li><a href=\"http&#58;//tinyurl.com/ms3bque\">Students\u2019 construction to understand relative sizes of exponential numbers&#160;</a><br></li></ul></div><div><strong>Dr Sadia Muzzafar Bhutta\u200b&#58;\u200b</strong></div><div><ul><li><a href=\"http&#58;//tinyurl.com/l8zxrcg\">Assessing the impact of AKU-IED professional development programmes on students\u2019 learning outcomes&#58; a quasi-experimental study&#160;</a><br></li><li><a href=\"http&#58;//tinyurl.com/m9rptd9\">Exploring efficacy of cluster-based mentoring programme for teachers\u2019 pedagogical practices&#160;</a><br></li><li><a href=\"http&#58;//tinyurl.com/k3r2vor\">Exploring nature and pattern of mentoring practices&#58; a study on mentees\u2019 perspectives&#160;\u200b\u200b</a><br></li></ul></div></div>",
